sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Browser
    participant FE as workspaces-frontend<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant BE as workspaces-backend<br/>4000/TCP HTTP/TLS 1.3
    participant AuthN as AuthN Middleware<br/>TokenReview
    participant AuthZ as AuthZ Middleware<br/>SubjectAccessReview
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant WH as Admission Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Ctrl as workspaces-controller
    participant Pod as Workspace Pod<br/>StatefulSet

    Note over User,Pod: Flow 1: User Creates a Workspace

    User->>FE: Browse workspace UI
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/workspaces/:namespace<br/>Authorization: Bearer <token>
    BE->>AuthN: Validate Bearer token
    AuthN->>K8s: TokenReview (validate token)
    K8s-->>AuthN: User identity + groups
    AuthN-->>BE: Authenticated identity
    BE->>AuthZ: Check permission
    AuthZ->>K8s: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(create workspaces in namespace)
    K8s-->>AuthZ: Allowed
    AuthZ-->>BE: Authorized
    BE->>K8s: Create Workspace CR<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8s->>WH: POST /validate-kubeflow-org-v1beta1-workspace<br/>HTTPS/9443, TLS
    WH-->>K8s: Admission Response (allowed)
    K8s-->>BE: Workspace created
    BE-->>FE: 201 Created (JSON)
    FE-->>User: Workspace created notification

    Note over User,Pod: Flow 2: Controller Reconciles Workspace

    K8s-->>Ctrl: Watch event: Workspace created
    Ctrl->>K8s: Get WorkspaceKind<br/>(resolve image, pod config)
    K8s-->>Ctrl: WorkspaceKind spec
    Ctrl->>K8s: Create StatefulSet<br/>(workspace pod spec)
    Ctrl->>K8s: Create Service<br/>(workspace access)
    Ctrl->>K8s: Create ServiceAccount + RoleBinding
    alt Gateway API mode
        Ctrl->>K8s: Create HTTPRoute + ReferenceGrant
    else Istio mode
        Ctrl->>K8s: Create VirtualService
    end
    K8s-->>Ctrl: Resources created
    Ctrl->>K8s: Update Workspace status

    Note over Ctrl,Pod: Activity Probe (periodic)

    Ctrl->>Pod: Activity probe<br/>(HTTP or pod/exec)
    Pod-->>Ctrl: Activity result
    alt Inactive beyond threshold
        Ctrl->>K8s: Scale StatefulSet to 0<br/>(auto-pause)
    end
